### C3 — PER-BRANCH LAYERNORM BEFORE FUSION (NB05, NB06 only)

In `HybridInternImageVMambaClassifier.__init__`, add normalization layers:
```python
# After determining vm_dim and im_dim:
self.vmamba_norm = nn.LayerNorm(vm_dim)   # NEW
self.intern_norm = nn.LayerNorm(im_dim)   # NEW

self.fusion_layer = nn.Sequential(nn.Linear(cat_dim, fus_dim), nn.GELU())
self.fusion_proj  = nn.Sequential(nn.Linear(fus_dim, fus_dim), nn.GELU())
self.dropout      = nn.Dropout(p=dropout_rate)
self.classifier   = nn.Linear(fus_dim, num_classes)
```

In `forward()`:
```python
def forward(self, x):
    x3   = self.adapter(x)
    f_vm = self.vmamba_norm(self.vmamba_extractor(x3))   # normalized
    f_im = self.intern_norm(self.intern_extractor(x3))   # normalized
    f    = torch.cat([f_im, f_vm], dim=1)
    f    = self.fusion_layer(f)
    f    = self.fusion_proj(f)
    f    = self.dropout(f)
    return self.classifier(f)
```

